Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.310 --> 00:00:01.780
- Sup y'all, this is Jay Park.

00:00:01.780 --> 00:00:03.613
I'm gonna teach you how to drink soju.

00:00:12.110 --> 00:00:16.120
Soju is the traditional drink of Korea.

00:00:16.120 --> 00:00:17.040
Everybody drinks it.

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:19.020
You can drink it with your buddies

00:00:19.020 --> 00:00:22.063
or you can drink it with
someone that's older than you.

00:00:22.172 --> 00:00:24.060
It kinda fits for any occasion.

00:00:24.060 --> 00:00:25.878
So what you do before you open the bottle

00:00:25.878 --> 00:00:28.223
is you whip it around, turn it around,

00:00:28.340 --> 00:00:30.090
hit it with your elbow for the sound

00:00:30.090 --> 00:00:31.033
or for the looks.

00:00:31.110 --> 00:00:32.993
And then you would crack it open.

00:00:34.392 --> 00:00:37.080
And what some people do
is they hit it like that

00:00:37.500 --> 00:00:39.100
just so all the stuff on the top

00:00:39.340 --> 00:00:41.130
and all the bad stuff comes out.

00:00:41.130 --> 00:00:42.830
And what you could do with the cap

00:00:43.020 --> 00:00:44.870
is some people like to
play a game with it.

00:00:44.870 --> 00:00:46.340
So you twist it around like this

00:00:46.340 --> 00:00:48.140
and then you take turns flicking it.

00:00:48.390 --> 00:00:50.803
Whoever flicks off this
little tail right here,

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.470
they have to drink the soju.

00:00:52.510 --> 00:00:54.863
If you're pouring for someone
that's elder than you,

00:00:54.880 --> 00:00:57.003
you wanna pour it with
two hands to show respect.

00:00:57.140 --> 00:00:58.023
Just like this.

00:00:58.940 --> 00:01:00.913
If it's your friend, just one hand.

00:01:02.350 --> 00:01:04.050
Because you're comfortable, close.

00:01:04.340 --> 00:01:05.880
Same thing when you're receiving it.

00:01:05.880 --> 00:01:08.093
If it's someone elder, two hands.

00:01:09.797 --> 00:01:10.630
Thank you.

00:01:12.540 --> 00:01:15.043
If it's your friend,
just one hand like this.

00:01:16.930 --> 00:01:18.610
And if it's someone elder, when you drink,

00:01:18.610 --> 00:01:19.443
you wanna drink

00:01:20.840 --> 00:01:23.590
with your back turned so that
they don't see you drink.

00:01:26.200 --> 00:01:27.350
It's a sign of respect.

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:29.100
So this is how you cheers.

00:01:31.018 --> 00:01:31.851
Gun-beh.

00:01:32.470 --> 00:01:33.773
I just taught you how to drink soju.

00:01:33.773 --> 00:01:37.183
It's Jay Park, only asian to
be signed under Roc Nation.

00:01:37.460 --> 00:01:38.540
You're gonna see much more on me, alright.

